#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function.rst:2
msgid "chemotools.adaptation.validation.check\\_metadata\\_function"
msgstr "chemotools.adaptation.validation.check\\_metadata\\_function"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:1
msgid "Validate a metadata function on representative data."
msgstr "Valida una función de metadatos con datos representativos."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:3
msgid ""
"The function is called once as ``func(X_checked, **metadata)``. Its output "
"is validated as a finite, numeric, 2-D array that preserves the number of "
"input samples and, by default, the number of input features."
msgstr ""
"La función se invoca una vez como ``func(X_checked, **metadata)``. Su salida "
"se valida como una matriz numérica, finita y bidimensional que conserva el "
"número de muestras de entrada y, de forma predeterminada, el número de "
"características de entrada."

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function.rst:0
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Parámetros"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:7
msgid "Function invoked as ``func(X_checked, **metadata)``."
msgstr "Función invocada como ``func(X_checked, **metadata)``."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:9
msgid "Representative input data."
msgstr "Datos de entrada representativos."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:11
msgid ""
"Representative keyword arguments passed to ``func``. Use ``None`` when the "
"function requires no metadata. The names ``\"X\"`` and ``\"y\"`` are "
"reserved by the estimator API and cannot be used as metadata keys."
msgstr ""
"Argumentos de palabra clave representativos que se pasan a ``func``. Utilice "
"``None`` cuando la función no requiera metadatos. Los nombres ``\"X\"`` e "
"``\"y\"`` están reservados por la API del estimador y no pueden utilizarse "
"como claves de metadatos."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:15
msgid ""
"If ``True``, require the output to have the same number of features as "
"``X``. The number of samples is always required to match."
msgstr ""
"Si es ``True``, exige que la salida tenga el mismo número de características "
"que ``X``. El número de muestras debe coincidir siempre."

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function.rst:0
msgid "Returns"
msgstr "Devuelve"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:19
msgid "**result** -- Validated output produced by ``func``."
msgstr "**result** -- Salida validada producida por ``func``."

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function.rst:0
msgid "Return type"
msgstr "Tipo de retorno"

#: ../../source/methods/generated/chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function.rst:0
msgid "Raises"
msgstr "Excepciones"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:22
msgid "If ``func`` is not callable or its signature cannot be inspected."
msgstr "Si ``func`` no es invocable o no se puede inspeccionar su firma."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:23
msgid ""
"If ``X`` is invalid, ``func`` cannot be called with the supplied     "
"arguments, its output is not a finite numeric 2-D array, or its output     "
"does not preserve the required dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Si ``X`` no es válido, ``func`` no se puede invocar con los argumentos     "
"proporcionados, su salida no es una matriz numérica bidimensional finita o "
"su salida     no conserva las dimensiones requeridas."

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:26
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Notas"

#: ../../../chemotools/adaptation/validation.py:docstring of
#: chemotools.adaptation.validation.check_metadata_function:27
msgid ""
"This check executes user-provided code. Exceptions raised by ``func`` are "
"propagated unchanged, and functions with side effects will perform those "
"side effects once. The validated input and output may be converted to NumPy "
"arrays by :func:`sklearn.utils.validation.check_array`."
msgstr ""
"Esta comprobación ejecuta código proporcionado por el usuario. Las "
"excepciones generadas por ``func`` se propagan sin cambios y las funciones "
"con efectos secundarios los ejecutarán una vez. La entrada y la salida "
"validadas se pueden convertir en matrices de NumPy "
"mediante :func:`sklearn.utils.validation.check_array`."

